Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: Bucket sort distributes n numbers uniformly drawn from [0,1) into n equal-width buckets using the index floor(n·x), keeps each bucket's list sorted by insertion, and then concatenates the buckets in index order to produce the sorted output.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): The bucket index floor(10x) already encodes the coarse ordering, so sorting reduces to tidying up tiny lists — concatenating the buckets in index order needs no comparisons across buckets at all.
DEMO STEPS: 5 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

